{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Maytham al-Tammar (r.a.)",
  "data": "At the grave of Maytham al-Tammar near Masjid al-Kufa, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA RASOOLALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَمِيْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA AMEERAL MU'MINEEN\nPeace be upon you, O Commander of the Faithful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا فَاطِمَةُ الزَّهْرَاۤءُ سَيِّدَةَ نِسَاۤءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA FAATIMATUZ ZAHRAA'U SAYYIDATA NISAA'IL A'ALAMEEN\nPeace be upon you, O Fatimah al-Zahra, mistress of the women of the worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAL HASANI WAL HUSAYNI SAYYIDAY SHABAABI AHLIL JANNAH\nPeace be upon al-Hasan and al-Husayn, the two masters of the youth of Paradise.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْاَئِمَّةِ مِنْ ذُرِّيَّةِ الْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAL A'IMMATI MIN DHURRIYYATIL HUSAYNI A'LAYHIMUS SALAAMU WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace be upon the Imams of the descendants of al-Husayn; upon them be peace, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ يَا مَيْثَمَ بْنَ يَحْيٰى التَّمَّارَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL A'BDUS SAALIHU YAA MAYTHAMABNA YAHYAT TAMMAAR\nPeace be upon you, O righteous servant, O Maytham son of Yahya, the date-seller,\nاَلْمُطِيْعُ لِلّٰهِ وَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَلِاَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَلِفَاطِمَةَ وَالْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ\nAL-MUTEE'U LILLAAHI WA LIRASOOLIHEE WA LI-AMEERIL MU'MINEENA WA LIFAATIMATA WAL HASANI WAL HUSAYN\nobedient to Allah, to His Messenger, to the Commander of the Faithful, to Fatimah, to al-Hasan and to al-Husayn.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلَاةَ وَاٰتَيْتَ الزَّكَاةَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA WA AATAYTAZ ZAKAAH\nI bear witness that you established the prayer and gave the alms,\nوَاَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ وَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ\nWA AMARTA BIL MA'ROOFI WA NAHAYTA A'NIL MUNKAR\nenjoined what is right and forbade what is wrong,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِي اللّٰهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهٖ\nWA JAAHADTA FILLAAHI HAQQA JIHAADIH\nstrove in the way of Allah with the striving due to Him,\nوَعَمِلْتَ بِكِتَابِهٖ مُقْتَدِيًا بِالصَّالِحِيْنَ وَمُتَّبِعًا لِلنَّبِيِّيْنَ\nWA A'MILTA BIKITAABIHEE MUQTADIYAN BIS SAALIHEENA WA MUTTABI'AN LIN NABIYYEEN\nand acted by His Book, following the example of the righteous and the way of the prophets.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قُتِلْتَ مَظْلُوْمًا\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKA QUTILTA MAZLOOMAA\nAnd I bear witness that you were killed unjustly.\nفَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ مَنْ ظَلَمَكَ وَمَنِ افْتَرٰى عَلَيْكَ وَمَنْ اَمَرَ بِقَتْلِكَ\nFALA'ANALLAAHU MAN ZALAMAKA WA MANIF TARAA A'LAYKA WA MAN AMARA BIQATLIK\nMay Allah curse whoever wronged you, whoever lied against you and whoever ordered your killing,\nوَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ مَنْ نَصَبَ لَكَ الْعَدَاوَةَ وَالْبَغْضَاۤءَ اِلٰى يَوْمِ الْقِيٰمَةِ\nWA LA'ANALLAAHU MAN NASABA LAKAL A'DAAWATA WAL BAGHDAA'A ILAA YAWMIL QIYAAMAH\nand may Allah curse whoever showed you enmity and hatred, until the Day of Resurrection.\nوَحَشَا اللّٰهُ قُبُوْرَهُمْ نَارًا وَاَعَدَّ لَهُمْ عَذَابًا اَلِيْمًا\nWA HASHALLAAHU QUBOORAHUM NAARAN WA A'ADDA LAHUM A'DHAABAN ALEEMAA\nMay Allah fill their graves with fire and prepare for them a painful punishment.\nجِئْتُكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ زَاۤئِرًا قَبْرَكَ\nJI'TUKA AYYUHAL A'BDUS SAALIHU ZAA'IRAN QABRAK\nI have come to you, O righteous servant, visiting your grave,\nمُقِرًّا بِحَقِّكَ مُعْتَرِفًا بِفَضْلِكَ\nMUQIRRAN BIHAQQIKA MU'TARIFAN BIFADLIK\naffirming your right and acknowledging your merit.\nفَاَسْاَلُ اللّٰهَ بِالشَّاْنِ الَّذِيْ لَكَ عِنْدَهٗ\nFA-AS'ALULLAAHA BISH SHA'NIL LADHEE LAKA I'NDAH\nSo I ask Allah, by the standing you have with Him,\nاَنْ يُّصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAN YUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nto bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad,\nوَاَنْ يَّقْضِيَ لَنَا حَوَاۤئِجَنَا فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nWA AN YAQDIYA LANAA HAWAA'IJANAA FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nand to fulfil our needs in this world and the Hereafter.\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nAnd the mercy of Allah and His blessings (be upon you).",
  "merits": "Maytham ibn Yahya al-Tammar, the date-seller of Kufa, was a freed slave and a close companion of Amir al-Mu'minin (a.s.), who taught him much hidden knowledge and foretold that he would be crucified for his love of the Ahl al-Bayt. Ibn Ziyad had him crucified in Kufa in 60 AH, ten days before Imam Husayn (a.s.) reached Iraq, as al-Mufid records in al-Irshad; from the cross he went on speaking of the virtues of the Ahl al-Bayt until his tongue was cut out. In a narration from Imam al-Kazim (a.s.) in Rijal al-Kashshi he is named among the disciples of Amir al-Mu'minin (a.s.).\n\nThis ziyarat is not in Mafatih al-Jinan; it is the form given in pilgrims' manuals for the ziyarats of Iraq."
}
